ue》、《The Knot》和《Emily Post》指南都将这些代码放在一个正式的阶梯上——一旦你看到梯级，穿好衣服只需五分钟。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.h2_text.what_it_means.504fca75":"这意味着什么","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.p_text.0_of_0_done.c7d9bf0c":"0 / 0 已完成","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.button_text.copy_result.76cfa6f1":"复制结果","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.button_text.download_txt.5f29b5ba":"下载 .txt","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.button_text.print_pdf.963ace37":"打印 / PDF","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.button_text.another_version.647b4bc0":"另一个版本","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.button_text.reset.526d688f":"重置","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.h2_text.one_ladder_ten_labels.f945d088":"一把梯子，十个标签","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.p_text.vogue_s_guide_to_modern_guest_dress_code.c467397c":"《Vogue》的现代宾客着装指南和美国礼仪排名页面都描述了相同的范围，从白色领带到休闲装。这种混乱来自于发明的标签——“浪漫花园装”、“高级休闲装”、“香槟梦”——情侣们越来越多地将这些标签印在邀请函上。 Emily Post 的指导是将发明的短语映射到最近的标准梯级，然后校准地点和一天中的时间。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.th_text.code.ca0dbad9":"代码","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.th_text.women.b133ad57":"女性","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.th_text.men.bbbcb4ec":"男士","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.white_tie.5445048f":"白领带","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.full_length_ball_gown.62d2302f":"全长舞会礼服","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.tailcoat_white_bow_tie_waistcoat.3ed55a9b":"燕尾服、白色领结、马甲","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.black_tie.6ad02ab9":"黑色领带","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.floor_length_gown_or_elegant_pantsuit.e04e7239":"及地长袍或优雅长裤套装","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.tuxedo_black_bow_tie.fc0e75e7":"燕尾服、黑色领结","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.black_tie_optional.19ac9aba":"黑色领带可选","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.long_gown_or_elevated_cocktail_dress.9ed42ca7":"长礼服或高雅鸡尾酒会礼服","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.tuxedo_or_dark_formal_suit_tie_required.a5aa3072":"燕尾服或深色正装，需要打领带","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.formal.557c6481":"正式的","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.long_dress_or_dressy_midi.2b6cf985":"长连衣裙或正装中长连衣裙","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.dark_suit_and_tie.fd91cd21":"深色西装和领带","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.cocktail.9aa6fd11":"鸡尾酒","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.knee_to_midi_dress_dressy_jumpsuit.c98363c8":"及膝中长连衣裙、考究连身裤","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.suit_tie_optional_in_summer.c3773f76":"夏季可选西装、领带","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.semi_formal.c0346919":"半正式","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.dressy_separates_or_a_polished_dress.52a2a636":"考究的单品或抛光连衣裙","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.blazer_dress_shirt_tie_optional.ba41e3ec":"西装外套、正装衬衫、领带可选","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.festive.e908b47c":"节日的","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.bold_colour_pattern_velvet.8d57bb61":"大胆的色彩、图案、天鹅绒","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.suit_with_personality.d37f95fd":"西装有个性","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.beach_garden.1e0729cc":"海滩/花园","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.flowy_midi_or_maxi_wedges_or_block_heels.d9d332c6":"飘逸中长鞋或长鞋、坡跟鞋或粗跟鞋","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.light_linen_suit_no_tie_loafers.4d23abd7":"浅色亚麻西装，不打领带，乐福鞋","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.casual.28d5d532":"随意的","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.sundress_or_refined_separates.5d152900":"背心裙或精致的单品","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.td_text.chinos_and_a_collared_shirt.a6a7800f":"斜纹棉布裤和有领衬衫","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.h2_text.the_rules_that_still_hold_in_2026.28bb75f1":"2026 年仍然适用的规则","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.strong_text.no_white_ivory_cream_or_champagne.e44f2bc7":"不含白色、象牙色、奶油色或香槟色","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.span_text.that_remains_the_firmest_rule_in_western.b56e477e":"——这仍然是西方婚礼礼仪中最严格的规则，包括“但上面有小花”。如果您知道新娘派对的颜色，请避免使用它。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.strong_text.black_is_now_fully_acceptable.609c78d0":"黑色现在完全可以接受","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.span_text.at_modern_us_and_european_weddings_the_o.8e57458e":"在现代美国和欧洲的婚礼上；旧的哀悼协会已基本消失，但一些家庭和信仰团体仍然保留着它。婚礼上的“休闲”仍然比沙发上的着装高出三层——只有在邀请函上字面上这么写的情况下才穿牛仔裤和运动鞋。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.h2_text.three_calibration_rules.b3a920a8":"三个校准规则","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.strong_text.ceremony_trumps_reception.85dca9eb":"仪式胜过接待。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.span_text.dress_for_the_most_formal_part_of_the_da.f243d6f1":"一天中最正式的时候着装；你可以稍后脱掉一件夹克。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.strong_text.venue_is_a_hint.5d73ce2b":"地点是一个提示。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.span_text.ballroom_means_go_up_a_rung_barn_or_beac.32abc0ea":"舞厅意味着登上一个台阶；谷仓或海滩意味着向下——除非邀请函另有说明。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.strong_text.when_in_doubt_overdress_slightly.a9527958":"如有疑问，请稍微穿得过多。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.span_text.slightly_overdressed_always_photographs.3cb3a650":"穿得稍微夸张一点总是能拍出更好的照片，给这对夫妇发一条 20 秒的短信可以消除整个晚上的感觉不对劲。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.span_text.if_you_are_the_couple_writing_that_line.cf5cc9b6":"如果您是在请柬上写下这句话的夫妇，请将标准措辞放在请柬或婚礼网站的右下角 - 一行可以节省 50 条文字。对于措辞本身，请参阅","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.invitation_maker.b3568f79":"邀请函制作者","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.h2_text.frequently_asked_questions.af2a4d28":"常见问题","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.summary_text.what_does_black_tie_optional_actually_me.815efbe7":"可选黑领带实际上意味着什么？","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.p_text.the_couple_wants_a_black_tie_look_but_wi.8f081023":"这对夫妇想要穿正装，但不会强迫你租礼服。男士：如果你有燕尾服，就穿燕尾服，否则就穿最深色的西装，搭配保守的领带。女士：长袍、正式中长裙或正装单品。 “可选”适用于晚礼服，而不是正式着装。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.summary_text.can_i_wear_black_to_a_wedding.657875d1":"参加婚礼可以穿黑色吗？","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.p_text.yes_black_is_fully_accepted_at_modern_us.c9fb1822":"是的。黑色在现代美国和欧洲婚礼中被完全接受，尤其是鸡尾酒会和正装领带婚礼。仅在明亮或喜庆的白天婚礼上避免使用，或通过配饰增添色彩。一些家庭和信仰团体仍然将其与哀悼联系在一起。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.summary_text.what_should_a_wedding_guest_never_wear.1891da80":"婚礼宾客不应该穿什么？","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.p_text.white_ivory_cream_or_anything_close_to_i.c177e422":"白色、象牙色、奶油色或任何类似颜色；新娘派对的确切颜色；牛仔裤和运动鞋，除非邀请函上注明休闲；以及任何足以吸引这对夫妇注意力的事情。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.summary_text.what_is_the_difference_between_formal_se.becef2c2":"正式、半正式和鸡尾酒会有何区别？","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.p_text.formal_sits_near_black_tie_optional_dark.85157320":"正式着装接近正式场合，可选择黑色领带（深色西装、长款或考究的中长连衣裙）。鸡尾酒会是最常见的美码（西装、及膝中长连衣裙）。半正式是一级（西装外套、正装分开）。如果不确定，请选择较高的梯级。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.summary_text.what_should_i_wear_to_a_beach_or_garden.dd9ea6b8":"参加海滩或花园婚礼我应该穿什么？","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.p_text.light_fabrics_linen_chiffon_cotton_women.b72e7139":"轻质面料——亚麻、雪纺、棉。女士：飘逸的中长鞋或长鞋，搭配坡跟鞋或粗跟鞋（细高跟鞋会陷入草地和沙子中）。男士：轻便西装或开领西装外套，不打领带，乐福鞋。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.summary_text.what_if_the_invitation_uses_an_invented.ab81959e":"如果邀请函使用了发明的着装要求怎么办？","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.p_text.map_the_phrase_to_the_nearest_standard_r.98708959":"将短语映射到最接近的标准梯级：“Romantic Garden Attire”是花园派对的半正式；“Romantic Garden Attire”是半正式的花园派对； “节日和乐趣”是一款色彩缤纷的鸡尾酒。然后查看婚礼网站上的“着装”说明，并校准场地和开始时间。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.h2_text.more_free_wedding_tools.511ec8cc":"更多免费婚礼工具","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.budget_calculator.4a2217e0":"预算计算器","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.seating_chart.0aa1b5db":"座位表","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.hashtag_generator.f0d774ee":"话题标签生成器","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.invitation_maker.eaa060de":"请柬制作工具","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.save_the_date.f3ad2c82":"婚期预告","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.photo_book_planner.a9887dd0":"照片书策划师","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.photo_collage.942e207a":"照片拼贴","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.heic_to_jpg.67ca8d18":"HEIC 转 JPG","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.planning_checklist.8d9c7c04":"婚礼筹备清单","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.alcohol_calculator.aa6ed7fc":"酒水计算器","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.vow_writer.90e3a3d2":"婚礼誓词撰写工具","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.speech_writer.7bd24d35":"致辞撰写","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.guest_count_calculator.3713f2ea":"宾客人数计算器","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.h2_text.dressed_up_get_it_on_film.b24db337":"打扮好了吗？把它拍成电影。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.p_text.the_outfits_the_vows_the_dance_floor_kee.2f4ad63e":"服装、誓言、舞池——将它们保留在由您的照片制作的电影婚礼影片中。","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.get_a_free_quote.076af0bf":"免费估价 →","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.button_text.save_pdf.71ddc50b":"保存.pdf","tools.wedding-dress-code-decoder.a_text.read_the_full_dress_code_guide_for_g.efc380da":"阅读完整的宾客着装指南"}